{"id":"b03a71cd282632fa","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-1gen.md","title":"1-generic 集合","display":"df-1gen — 1-generic 集合","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-1gen","aliases":["20-df-1gen"],"display":"df-1gen — 1-generic 集合","chapter":"6","section":"6.3","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"Definition 6.3.1","source_pdf_pages":[171],"source_printed_pages":[137],"depends_on":["[[20-df-strings]]","[[20-df-re]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-1gen"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-1gen</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-1gen — 1-generic 集合"},{"key":"chapter","html":"6"},{"key":"section","html":"6.3"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Definition 6.3.1"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>171</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>137</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"755e421576224435\" href=\"?note=755e421576224435\" title=\"20-df-strings\">20-df-strings</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"60af447f5d59a8dc\" href=\"?note=60af447f5d59a8dc\" title=\"20-df-re\">20-df-re</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\in2^\\omega\">\\(G\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>；有限串集合通过固定编码判定 c.e.。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"755e421576224435\" href=\"?note=755e421576224435\" title=\"20-df-strings\">20-df-strings</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"60af447f5d59a8dc\" href=\"?note=60af447f5d59a8dc\" title=\"20-df-re\">20-df-re</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}1gen}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{1Generic}(G)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall S\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega}\\ [\\operatorname{code}[S]\\in\\mathcal E\\Rightarrow\n(\\exists\\sigma\\preceq G\\ \\sigma\\in S)\\lor\n(\\exists\\sigma\\preceq G\\ \\forall\\tau\\succeq\\sigma\\ \\tau\\notin S)].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}1gen}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{1Generic}(G)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall S\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega}\\ [\\operatorname{code}[S]\\in\\mathcal E\\Rightarrow\n(\\exists\\sigma\\preceq G\\ \\sigma\\in S)\\lor\n(\\exists\\sigma\\preceq G\\ \\forall\\tau\\succeq\\sigma\\ \\tau\\notin S)].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>第二分支是避开：存在一个前缀，其全部延伸均不在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>。只要求碰到所有稠密 c.e. 集合是 weak 1-generic，不能代替此定义。集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(G\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span> 的版本使用其特征函数。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 6.3.1；印刷页 137；PDF 第 171 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-strings","status":"resolved","id":"755e421576224435","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-strings]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-re","status":"resolved","id":"60af447f5d59a8dc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-re]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-strings","status":"resolved","id":"755e421576224435","anchor":"ref-3","targetAn